## How to Compile and Run

To compile using the Makefile:  
make

To clean compiled files:  
make clean

To run the shell:  
make run

## Notes

- This shell is intentionally minimal
- It does not support:
  - Pipes (|)
  - Redirection (< >)
  - Background processes (&)
- It is designed to demonstrate shell behavior and system call usage
